WEBVTT

00:00:05.760 --> 00:00:07.980
U-Um...

00:00:08.380 --> 00:00:11.490
Um... why are you sitting so close to me?

00:00:12.180 --> 00:00:14.420
If you want to know your companion,

00:00:14.420 --> 00:00:16.860
it's most effective to sit beside them.

00:00:16.860 --> 00:00:19.210
That's Dating 101.

00:00:19.210 --> 00:00:21.000
See? And now you know.

00:00:21.630 --> 00:00:26.500
Now you won't commit the boorish blunder
of sitting across from your date.

00:00:32.340 --> 00:00:35.840
Whoa. Way too close!
Please back off a little!

00:00:38.340 --> 00:00:40.100
I want you.

00:00:40.100 --> 00:00:41.420
Huh?!

00:00:44.510 --> 00:00:46.300
In between the Zepharos Empire to the north

00:00:46.300 --> 00:00:49.510
and the Chevron Kingdom to the south

00:00:49.510 --> 00:00:51.410
lies Lautreamont Knight Country.

00:00:51.410 --> 00:00:53.630
Known as "Dragon-Rearing Land,"

00:00:53.630 --> 00:00:58.080
it boasts the largest dragon population on the Arc Strada continent.

00:00:58.080 --> 00:01:01.620
This small country with fewer than five million citizens

00:01:01.620 --> 00:01:04.560
is home to a unique school:

00:01:04.560 --> 00:01:06.930
Ansullivan Dragonar Academy.

00:01:06.930 --> 00:01:09.070
It aims to educate and guide dragon masters

00:01:09.070 --> 00:01:12.140
and the so-called Breeders,
those young men and women

00:01:12.140 --> 00:01:15.260
who have entered into bonds with dragons.

00:02:49.160 --> 00:02:53.260
I summoned you to the Student Council room for a reason. I must ask.

00:02:54.690 --> 00:02:56.220
Ash Blake.

00:02:56.220 --> 00:02:57.280
Y-Yeah?

00:02:57.840 --> 00:03:00.180
Don't you want to be on the Student Council?

00:03:00.180 --> 00:03:00.780
Huh?

00:03:11.380 --> 00:03:13.420
How does it taste, Lancelot?

00:03:18.610 --> 00:03:25.080
Oh, Lancelot. I became a Dragonar
all because you grew into a Maestro.

00:03:25.080 --> 00:03:27.430
Next I'll be an Archdragonar.

00:03:28.570 --> 00:03:30.930
<i>I promised him I would.</i>

00:03:32.230 --> 00:03:33.940
<i>That I'd be a fine, upstanding knight.</i>

00:03:40.850 --> 00:03:42.450
But still...

00:03:42.910 --> 00:03:45.780
what is <i>with</i> that joker, Ash Blake?

00:03:46.410 --> 00:03:50.170
Being able to ride other people's Pals like that defies common sense.

00:03:50.170 --> 00:03:51.960
He must have something up his sleeve.

00:03:51.960 --> 00:03:52.540
Watch out!

00:03:52.960 --> 00:03:54.960
Dragon on the loose!

00:04:03.300 --> 00:04:06.300
Y-Your Highness! A young Strada just up and-

00:04:15.060 --> 00:04:17.740
M-Me? On the Student Council?

00:04:17.740 --> 00:04:18.720
That's right.

00:04:18.720 --> 00:04:19.690
But...

00:04:21.020 --> 00:04:24.200
Think about that sketchy pair you ran across in the woods.

00:04:29.100 --> 00:04:32.970
If they <i>were</i> Imperial spies,

00:04:32.970 --> 00:04:35.710
it's possible that they have the Academy in their sights.

00:04:36.880 --> 00:04:39.270
Ever since the war fifty-two years ago,

00:04:39.270 --> 00:04:45.640
the Zepharos Empire has mistaken Ansullivan Dragonar Academy for a military school.

00:04:45.640 --> 00:04:46.760
But it's not.

00:04:46.760 --> 00:04:48.170
Exactly.

00:04:49.250 --> 00:04:53.180
And as long as I, Rebecca Randall, and my Cu Chulainn are around,

00:04:53.180 --> 00:04:55.100
they won't get away with it, either!

00:04:57.560 --> 00:05:01.480
That's why I'd like you to help as
a member of the Student Council.

00:05:02.190 --> 00:05:03.860
B-But I-

00:05:04.380 --> 00:05:06.360
Think it over, won't you?

00:05:09.450 --> 00:05:10.710
Wh-What's that?!

00:05:10.710 --> 00:05:12.370
A Level 2 alert?

00:05:16.630 --> 00:05:18.230
Now calm down!

00:05:18.230 --> 00:05:19.250
Behave yours-

00:05:20.380 --> 00:05:23.070
Why? Why would the princess
do something so rash?

00:05:23.070 --> 00:05:25.680
Probably out of rivalry with you.

00:05:25.680 --> 00:05:26.380
Huh?

00:05:26.910 --> 00:05:30.760
Her Highness is a perfectionist and an extremely sore loser.

00:05:31.170 --> 00:05:34.030
She wouldn't blithely accept
having a classmate

00:05:34.030 --> 00:05:36.230
who can expertly ride any
dragon you throw at him.

00:05:37.080 --> 00:05:39.510
No need to worry.

00:05:41.260 --> 00:05:42.230
Rebecca!

00:05:44.550 --> 00:05:46.820
Heed my call.

00:05:47.460 --> 00:05:48.570
Cu Chulainn!

00:05:53.920 --> 00:06:00.240
Rebecca Randall commands thee:
Present unto me the Arch thou hath created!

00:06:13.860 --> 00:06:15.600
So that's Arch!

00:06:26.650 --> 00:06:29.160
Mm, scrumptious!

00:06:29.160 --> 00:06:31.260
<i>All that commotion...</i>

00:06:35.480 --> 00:06:38.980
<i>Everything worked out in the end, thanks to Rebecca.</i>

00:06:41.050 --> 00:06:43.590
<i>But the princess sees me as a rival?</i>

00:06:43.590 --> 00:06:44.680
Ow!

00:06:44.680 --> 00:06:46.840
Ow, ow, ow!

00:06:46.840 --> 00:06:50.170
You've got a lot of nerve
ignoring me like that!

00:06:50.170 --> 00:06:52.450
S-Sorry! I was just thinking...

00:06:52.450 --> 00:06:55.070
I said, why are all those
people gathered there?

00:06:56.200 --> 00:07:00.050
Those are tourists, here to see the statue of St. Durham.

00:07:00.050 --> 00:07:01.600
St. Durham?

00:07:01.990 --> 00:07:05.100
First-generation paladin Durham Lautreamont.

00:07:05.100 --> 00:07:07.770
He lived some five hundred years ago.

00:07:08.990 --> 00:07:11.410
That armor... It's Arch, right?

00:07:11.410 --> 00:07:12.720
You can tell?

00:07:12.720 --> 00:07:16.190
The Draguarth includes
some Arch design sketches.

00:07:16.190 --> 00:07:16.870
Oh?

00:07:17.190 --> 00:07:21.750
That said, the sketches our ancestors left behind are really just for reference.

00:07:22.080 --> 00:07:26.380
So will you make me an
original Arch one day too?

00:07:28.080 --> 00:07:31.590
I guess you'll have to
become a Maestro first, huh?

00:07:32.130 --> 00:07:36.910
How dare you?! Why should I have to make an Arch for my dog?!

00:07:36.910 --> 00:07:39.390
It's against the laws of nature!

00:07:39.390 --> 00:07:40.640
Sheesh, where did that come from?

00:07:41.030 --> 00:07:44.020
That's right. We learned about it in class.

00:07:44.020 --> 00:07:47.500
For dragonkind, presenting an Arch to their master

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:49.650
is part of giving up their entire selves-

00:07:52.910 --> 00:07:55.030
Ow!

00:07:59.620 --> 00:08:01.410
It can't be!

00:08:02.040 --> 00:08:03.540
Is he the same...

00:08:12.760 --> 00:08:16.140
How am I going to tell Master Milgauss?

00:08:18.040 --> 00:08:19.640
Well, well!

00:08:20.090 --> 00:08:23.390
We meet again, I see,
and in such a lovely setting.

00:08:29.350 --> 00:08:32.400
The Dragonfang Inn is second to none in taste and quantity.

00:08:35.150 --> 00:08:39.450
Plus, Student Council members can eat here for half off.

00:08:39.450 --> 00:08:41.980
Go on, eat up.

00:08:41.980 --> 00:08:44.420
But why are you two here?

00:08:45.190 --> 00:08:48.790
That date ticket from the Dragonar Festival.

00:08:48.790 --> 00:08:52.760
Her Highness must fulfill her
obligations as the winner.

00:08:53.160 --> 00:08:56.110
She seems to have a lot on her mind lately.

00:08:56.110 --> 00:08:59.510
I wanted her to open up and talk to me today,

00:09:00.100 --> 00:09:02.440
but, well, you see how she is.

00:09:15.520 --> 00:09:17.530
Ow, ow, ow!

00:09:18.670 --> 00:09:19.410
Anya?

00:09:20.460 --> 00:09:21.210
Anya!

00:09:21.660 --> 00:09:22.940
What's wrong?

00:09:22.940 --> 00:09:24.700
N-Nothing.

00:09:26.010 --> 00:09:27.670
How are things in town?

00:09:28.200 --> 00:09:30.240
V-Very relaxed.

00:09:30.240 --> 00:09:32.920
They've all but forgotten about the war.

00:09:33.230 --> 00:09:34.590
But of course.

00:09:34.590 --> 00:09:38.770
No one here uses dragons as weapons.

00:09:38.770 --> 00:09:41.430
Ansullivan is a very friendly town.

00:09:42.380 --> 00:09:45.460
However, its friendliness is meaningless.

00:09:53.560 --> 00:09:55.100
Now, Deep One.

00:09:55.100 --> 00:09:57.400
A darkness and light more
irresistible than death's abyss.

00:09:57.770 --> 00:09:59.790
Its blood, its flesh...

00:09:59.790 --> 00:10:01.940
Ashes to ashes, dust to dust.

00:10:01.940 --> 00:10:05.310
Come forth, promised child of magica-technica!

00:10:14.000 --> 00:10:14.760
What is it?

00:10:14.760 --> 00:10:17.510
Nothing good.

00:10:17.510 --> 00:10:19.330
Wh-What is that?

00:10:36.700 --> 00:10:38.080
Run!

00:10:43.900 --> 00:10:45.540
Wh-What is that?!

00:10:46.410 --> 00:10:48.540
A... dragon?

00:10:49.800 --> 00:10:51.880
Its flesh is rotten!

00:11:07.450 --> 00:11:08.520
Eco!

00:11:09.490 --> 00:11:13.430
Hold it, you oaf! Just who do you think I am?

00:11:13.430 --> 00:11:17.280
This town is full of fantastic boutiques, you know?!

00:11:17.850 --> 00:11:20.160
What on earth is she doing?

00:11:21.280 --> 00:11:24.600
So be a good boy and back off, would ya?

00:11:31.790 --> 00:11:33.540
Eco!

00:11:35.540 --> 00:11:37.220
Watch where you're grabbing!

00:11:37.220 --> 00:11:38.550
Why, you...

00:11:38.830 --> 00:11:40.550
That's enough!

00:11:40.910 --> 00:11:43.050
Dammit! What should we do?

00:12:06.330 --> 00:12:07.330
Rebecca!

00:12:07.810 --> 00:12:10.940
Manifest now, O ye
sure-striking mystic spear...

00:12:10.940 --> 00:12:12.080
Its name:

00:12:13.770 --> 00:12:15.080
Gae Bulg!

00:12:30.420 --> 00:12:31.600
Get him!

00:12:36.100 --> 00:12:37.370
All right!

00:12:41.960 --> 00:12:43.110
It's growing back?

00:12:43.110 --> 00:12:44.610
What <i>is</i> this thing?

00:12:51.360 --> 00:12:54.240
Ash! Take the princess and get out of here! Hurry!

00:12:59.120 --> 00:13:00.250
Princess!

00:13:01.340 --> 00:13:04.120
Snap out of it, Princess!

00:13:05.260 --> 00:13:08.260
Geez! What's with this thing, anyway?

00:13:08.620 --> 00:13:09.520
Eco...

00:13:09.520 --> 00:13:12.000
She hasn't given up yet!

00:13:12.000 --> 00:13:12.770
Princess!

00:13:14.600 --> 00:13:17.230
Geez! Some princess <i>you</i> are!

00:13:17.230 --> 00:13:21.150
Times like these are when your capacity as a royal gets put to the test!

00:13:21.150 --> 00:13:23.360
Here. I'll apologize in advance:

00:13:23.760 --> 00:13:24.610
Sorry!

00:13:31.440 --> 00:13:32.620
Ash...

00:13:33.090 --> 00:13:34.940
I need to ask you a favor.

00:13:34.940 --> 00:13:38.280
Summon Lancelot, and let me ride him!

00:13:38.280 --> 00:13:40.130
Ride him? Where?

00:13:40.400 --> 00:13:41.880
Over there!

00:13:42.320 --> 00:13:44.600
I can ride any dragon.

00:13:44.600 --> 00:13:47.620
I might be able to hold him off.

00:13:47.620 --> 00:13:49.200
What? Are you crazy?!

00:13:49.200 --> 00:13:51.810
C'mon, just call Lancelot already!

00:13:51.810 --> 00:14:00.410
Eco!

00:14:04.590 --> 00:14:07.070
Get on! You might still have a chance!

00:14:18.920 --> 00:14:20.670
H-Hey!

00:14:20.670 --> 00:14:22.500
Don't touch me in weird places!

00:14:22.500 --> 00:14:24.840
Who do you think I am?!

00:14:24.840 --> 00:14:27.010
I am an honorable drago—

00:14:29.960 --> 00:14:31.430
Cut it out!

00:14:46.590 --> 00:14:50.270
Hello, Eco. This is the Highdragon Workshop,

00:14:51.000 --> 00:14:53.530
and I am Navi.

00:14:54.100 --> 00:14:55.040
Navi?

00:14:55.570 --> 00:14:59.320
Someone who will teach and guide you while you are still immature.

00:14:59.320 --> 00:15:01.540
Yes, that sounds about right.

00:15:02.040 --> 00:15:04.040
Why... do you look like that?

00:15:04.430 --> 00:15:09.050
Anyway, listen. If this keeps up, he will die.

00:15:09.050 --> 00:15:10.550
Are you all right with that?

00:15:11.080 --> 00:15:11.800
Ash!

00:15:18.800 --> 00:15:23.580
True, he has a natural capability to ride any dragon whatsoever.

00:15:23.580 --> 00:15:24.980
But he needs more.

00:15:24.980 --> 00:15:27.650
As matters stand, he can't defeat a Necromancia.

00:15:28.110 --> 00:15:29.400
A Necromancia?

00:15:29.880 --> 00:15:34.910
A dead dragon, resurrected by artificial means.

00:15:36.510 --> 00:15:38.530
When you say he needs more...

00:15:38.530 --> 00:15:39.410
His Arch?

00:15:39.910 --> 00:15:40.910
Bingo.

00:15:46.400 --> 00:15:50.440
This Highdragon Workshop is a shared space

00:15:50.440 --> 00:15:53.500
created by the sacred dragons, known as Maestros, that are craft workers.

00:15:54.300 --> 00:15:58.180
The Arch is one of the things the Maestros produced.

00:15:58.720 --> 00:16:01.940
But an Arch is a made-to-order set of armor.

00:16:02.370 --> 00:16:05.950
A mere copy would fit poorly,

00:16:05.950 --> 00:16:08.940
possibly even endangering the life of the wearer.

00:16:09.260 --> 00:16:10.940
So what should I do?

00:16:11.410 --> 00:16:12.770
Simple.

00:16:12.770 --> 00:16:18.600
Pick and choose the best-fitting parts
from among the many sketches here,

00:16:18.600 --> 00:16:19.950
and put them all together.

00:16:20.510 --> 00:16:24.460
I have his size data right here.

00:16:24.930 --> 00:16:26.460
When did you collect this?

00:16:27.150 --> 00:16:31.470
I fiddled around a bit in his dreams before you were born.

00:16:31.470 --> 00:16:34.420
Don't mess with my dog, you hear me?

00:16:34.420 --> 00:16:36.030
So what will you do?

00:16:36.030 --> 00:16:38.690
Are you put off by the
sheer number of sketches?

00:16:39.160 --> 00:16:43.300
Is the idea of selecting each part so daunting
that you'll give up before you even begin?

00:16:43.300 --> 00:16:45.790
That smirk of yours really ticks me off!

00:16:45.790 --> 00:16:46.480
Of course!

00:16:47.060 --> 00:16:49.110
Of course I'll do it!

00:16:54.010 --> 00:16:55.050
Are you okay?

00:16:55.050 --> 00:16:56.850
Y-Yeah. Sorry.

00:16:56.850 --> 00:16:58.770
Lancelot has reached his limits,

00:16:58.770 --> 00:17:01.100
and you won't hold out much longer yourself.

00:17:01.100 --> 00:17:02.200
I know!

00:17:02.200 --> 00:17:04.460
Still, I can tell.

00:17:04.460 --> 00:17:07.460
The astral flow is telling me, through my starbrand.

00:17:08.050 --> 00:17:09.960
Eco is still alive!

00:17:10.290 --> 00:17:13.980
As long as this is glowing, I'll never give up!

00:17:13.980 --> 00:17:17.470
So you'd better hang in there, too, Eco!

00:17:20.040 --> 00:17:21.600
I'll save you!

00:17:21.600 --> 00:17:23.480
Don't give up!

00:17:26.090 --> 00:17:30.480
He's pretty full of himself... for a pet dog.

00:17:34.310 --> 00:17:36.320
The mana is increasing.

00:17:36.320 --> 00:17:38.110
The bond between Breeder and Pal,

00:17:38.110 --> 00:17:40.740
no, between Ash and Eco...

00:17:40.740 --> 00:17:41.710
I see it!

00:17:41.710 --> 00:17:46.500
Almete, gorjal, peto, espaldar, brafonera, falda!

00:17:47.760 --> 00:17:53.010
Bujeta, hombrera, brazal, guarda, greba, escarpe!

00:17:53.010 --> 00:17:54.750
Espolazo!

00:18:00.260 --> 00:18:03.070
Ash!

00:18:03.070 --> 00:18:05.410
What a waste, giving this to a dog.

00:18:05.410 --> 00:18:05.920
Huh?

00:18:05.920 --> 00:18:07.020
Take it!

00:18:15.510 --> 00:18:16.780
But this...

00:18:17.620 --> 00:18:19.360
It's an Arch!

00:18:19.360 --> 00:18:20.780
How awe-inspiring.

00:18:22.270 --> 00:18:26.290
I-I didn't make this just for you, okay?

00:18:26.610 --> 00:18:30.440
It's not an original. It's just some makeshift armor!

00:18:30.440 --> 00:18:32.540
You'd better not think of it as a present!

00:18:34.480 --> 00:18:36.410
Thanks, Eco.

00:18:36.410 --> 00:18:39.440
With this, I feel unstoppable.

00:18:39.440 --> 00:18:40.470
Princess!

00:18:41.470 --> 00:18:42.720
Understood!

00:18:45.060 --> 00:18:47.230
Lancelot really is a good dragon.

00:18:48.040 --> 00:18:49.230
What?

00:18:49.540 --> 00:18:51.550
You've got the best Pal.

00:18:51.550 --> 00:18:56.080
Don't try anything crazy
like riding other dragons.

00:18:56.080 --> 00:18:58.940
Wh-What are you talking about?
And why now?

00:19:02.620 --> 00:19:03.740
Ash...

00:19:05.240 --> 00:19:07.900
You may be deity or devil,

00:19:07.900 --> 00:19:10.750
but as long as you're a dragon, I will ride you!

00:19:19.170 --> 00:19:20.760
Master Milgauss...

00:19:20.760 --> 00:19:23.200
Quite an unexpected ambush.

00:19:24.930 --> 00:19:27.530
The experiment has ended in failure.

00:19:27.530 --> 00:19:29.460
But it was not without purpose.

00:19:29.460 --> 00:19:31.520
We have that boy... and that girl.

00:19:31.960 --> 00:19:34.020
The girl?

00:19:34.020 --> 00:19:35.330
Let us retreat.

00:19:43.120 --> 00:19:45.990
Necromancia? Is that you?

00:19:46.540 --> 00:19:49.500
So you had a master once as well.

00:19:52.160 --> 00:19:54.250
Are you... sure about that?

00:19:56.140 --> 00:19:59.630
All right. Leave it to me!

00:19:59.630 --> 00:20:02.760
Manifest now, O ye light-graced sword.

00:20:02.760 --> 00:20:06.460
Grant unto me the power to purge all darkness!

00:20:06.460 --> 00:20:07.640
Its name:

00:20:07.640 --> 00:20:10.140
The divine blade, Aix-les-Bains!

00:20:37.720 --> 00:20:38.920
Eco!

00:20:40.820 --> 00:20:41.920
Ash!

00:21:17.620 --> 00:21:20.470
Congratulations once again
on getting your Pal!

00:21:20.470 --> 00:21:21.880
Thanks, Raymond.

00:21:21.880 --> 00:21:28.510
This has made me painfully aware of the Student Council's shortcomings.

00:21:28.800 --> 00:21:30.510
Ash, Silvia.

00:21:30.510 --> 00:21:34.020
Again, I urge you two to
join the Student Council.

00:21:34.350 --> 00:21:38.410
If Lancelot and I can be of any use, I'll join.

00:21:38.410 --> 00:21:42.150
We must not let an attack like that happen ever again.

00:21:43.310 --> 00:21:44.150
And you, Ash?

00:21:44.150 --> 00:21:45.340
I...

00:21:46.640 --> 00:21:48.660
All right. I'll do it.

00:21:48.950 --> 00:21:52.960
Then let's get the joining ceremony over with right here.

00:21:59.170 --> 00:22:04.420
Hey! How dare you go all googly-eyed over a human female when you're <i>my</i> pet?!

00:22:04.420 --> 00:22:06.430
Um, Miss President?

00:22:06.430 --> 00:22:09.430
That's not how my joining ceremony-

00:22:09.430 --> 00:22:13.890
And to celebrate our new additions to the Student Council...

00:22:13.890 --> 00:22:16.070
You're so mean. Ow...

00:22:17.890 --> 00:22:19.960
Cheers!

00:22:19.960 --> 00:22:21.900
I can't reach.

00:23:52.920 --> 00:23:54.160
Hi, Ash Blake.

00:23:54.160 --> 00:23:56.180
Is it true that you are a real masochist?

00:23:56.180 --> 00:23:57.580
Where did you hear that?

00:23:57.580 --> 00:24:01.820
Whereas I am a hell of a sadist.
<i>And</i> a real masochist.

00:24:01.820 --> 00:24:03.290
Wow, uh, thanks for sharing!

